ust before the rest."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I stop smoke filling the kitchen?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Use less oil, wipe it thin with paper, choose a high smoke point oil and switch on the extractor before you start. Smoking oil means the pan is hotter than the food needs."}}]}]}</script>
